 "Gist: Classic typographic systems give students multiple ways to structure space and movement."}, {"id": "13684301-8edd-4fc2-a093-e73ca2c6ca7f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Cross-format systems", "children": [{"id": "4ec011e3-cd62-452b-90b7-2cf8a5ff4778", "type": "concept", "title": "Poster series"}, {"id": "fd8facf9-8cf4-4a0b-abdc-50202d45c07e", "type": "concept", "title": "Editorial spreads"}, {"id": "255863d5-e67a-41e3-b3e9-9d5716d5447d", "type": "concept", "title": "Digital screens"}, {"id": "9b11896c-7e6d-467e-9a2b-8dcc02637d6a", "type": "concept", "title": "Campaign families"}], "description": "Gist: A system proves itself when it adapts across different formats without losing identity."}]}, {"id": "a09d45b4-2b18-4f6f-afa8-0e1faee12328", "type": "topic", "title": "Hierarchy in Complex Documents", "description": "Design multi-level information so readers can scan, compare, enter, and navigate content efficiently.", "children": [{"id": "12547b1f-4e22-4fbc-a94b-8230725a6d2b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Information levels", "children": [{"id": "56450bbe-9664-4130-85da-79180023ce62", "type": "concept", "title": "Heading levels"}, {"id": "11927b6e-112b-48f7-b572-d7164b1feee6", "type": "concept", "title": "Decks and summaries"}, {"id": "82d4fccc-184e-4bf8-851c-a92448682772", "type": "concept", "title": "Captions and credits"}, {"id": "0cea20d3-7168-491a-98ed-c8ae7e7d9ed9", "type": "concept", "title": "Sidebars and notes"}], "description": "Gist: Complex documents require clear differentiation among titles, sections, captions, notes, and supporting data."}, {"id": "8a92e842-64f4-491d-9a4b-3b89ca0ffd28", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Navigation and scanning", "children": [{"id": "40492816-543d-44c9-84d5-f91a1637e243", "type": "concept", "title": "Running heads"}, {"id": "9743c219-0ebe-4c94-8917-63873afeefe7", "type": "concept", "title": "Tables of contents"}, {"id": "26e08032-9827-4742-aa8c-93e5316922a2", "type": "concept", "title": "Section markers"}, {"id": "855f552d-6559-450e-9cf9-064f887eb44b", "type": "concept", "title": "Callouts and pull quotes"}], "description": "Gist: Hierarchy should help readers enter a document at different points and still understand where they are."}, {"id": "c9126b47-e9cc-41ba-8af7-753e588ad7b7", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Dense content management", "children": [{"id": "09d30069-9b42-4daf-85b1-64e1f739aaf0", "type": "concept", "title": "Tables"}, {"id": "c858123e-7df8-43b4-9dac-3ef4bc3b7cec", "type": "concept", "title": "Reference material"}, {"id": "2a7b0812-65c5-4ba5-9db3-acf25c70cf02", "type": "concept", "title": "Legal or technical text"}, {"id": "82344e2c-f839-40dd-aecb-6eaed233813e", "type": "concept", "title": "Multi-column structures"}], "description": "Gist: Advanced typography often means making difficult material feel calm, navigable, and trustworthy."}]}, {"id": "43bbefc7-8319-4ee1-9d39-8a678feb50a0", "type": "topic", "title": "Typeface Pairing, Superfamilies, and Type Palettes", "description": "Build sophisticated type palettes that balance contrast, compatibility, voice, and functional coverage.", "children": [{"id": "ebc448ce-1c69-4c5f-84ba-188c7a4054ee", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Pairing strategies", "children": [{"id": "68907c1d-35ba-4947-9cef-50906bb9470e", "type": "concept", "title": "Serif and sans pairing"}, {"id": "ca111836-eb6b-4964-b526-a9e5443e7045", "type": "concept", "title": "Display plus text"}, {"id": "413ae116-c491-4c29-b026-108b6c034540", "type": "concept", "title": "Historical compatibility"}, {"id": "514be878-c517-4927-b65f-8097f909dfa9", "type": "concept", "title": "Functional contrast"}], "description": "Gist: Strong pairings create useful contrast without visual conflict."}, {"id": "cd4a19bc-5102-48a9-960a-9df468fb1b35", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Superfamilies and variable families", "children": [{"id": "7c2583f8-96c1-4fb6-9445-46caee1d9ea0", "type": "concept", "title": "Text and display cuts"}, {"id": "1b118603-971f-4bc3-90b8-55ba2da8536e", "type": "concept", "title": "Optical sizes"}, {"id": "83f962c5-eb72-4cde-890c-10f1d4d3a23c", "type": "concept", "title": "Weights and widths"}, {"id": "bb700c97-52b2-4f5c-9471-59040da6acf1", "type": "concept", "title": "Italic and oblique choices"}], "description": "Gist: Large families support complex systems through coordinated variation."}, {"id": "b7fab74e-32fa-4775-96da-26de5562c559", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Palette governance", "children": [{"id": "03005bfb-401c-46ff-ad97-cc639369ca84", "type": "concept", "title": "Usage rules"}, {"id": "4d9dab11-3b8e-4f6c-b3ab-d8243b784fa5", "type": "concept", "title": "Fallbacks"}, {"id": "3b680702-1473-4506-a851-9e50d7ea0a7b", "type": "concept", "title": "Tone mapping"}, {"id": "0a1f8860-0fef-42b0-beb6-b932b5b0dcc2", "type": "concept", "title": "Do and do-not examples"}], "description": "Gist: A type palette needs rules so future design decisions remain consistent."}]}, {"id": "336c5a64-2869-4173-903f-72f50bd6a3fd", "type": "topic", "title": "Typographic Detail and Microtypography", "description": "Refine spacing, punctuation, rhythm, and text settings until typography feels deliberate and professionally finished.", "children": [{"id": "9224529c-7863-4567-884e-6e108de62572", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Text rhythm", "children": [{"id": "55cc6836-6f1e-46e8-ad39-e7a1052e12db", "type": "concept", "title": "Measure"}, {"id": "3ebbb2eb-cf22-427a-a7e0-739d40d335f9", "type": "concept", "title": "Leading"}, {"id": "ebbf05e0-301d-483e-a61c-8eb32225bf01", "type": "concept", "title": "Rag control"}, {"id": "9d84d6ec-c38d-412e-a420-0c2b9a965bfd", "type": "concept", "title": "Hyphenation and justification"}], "description": "Gist: Microtypography is the craft of making paragraphs read smoothly and feel optically even."}, {"id": "0870970c-95c8-4f15-bf45-5a23dfa9eaaa", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Spacing refinement", "children": [{"id": "13e8455a-3f0c-49c4-9163-89011d763e70", "type": "concept", "title": "Kerning"}, {"id": "3febcab