"title": "Annotated precedent boards"}], "description": "Gist: Advanced designers build arguments from typographic history, context, and observed examples."}, {"id": "c897ed8a-e0e1-41f3-837c-cfa2e916482e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Critique methods", "children": [{"id": "9309615a-a8ad-4d8a-9813-c921ffb3fc2d", "type": "concept", "title": "Close looking"}, {"id": "fa1cfc62-e015-4f80-a000-8d47fcb0bb58", "type": "concept", "title": "Evidence-based feedback"}, {"id": "676ef8b5-e1f8-402f-b164-1dd9fc7548ee", "type": "concept", "title": "Hierarchy diagnosis"}, {"id": "d25d2933-cea9-493e-9e4c-a32a7c9cb3dc", "type": "concept", "title": "Revision priorities"}], "description": "Gist: Critique should produce specific improvements rather than vague preference statements."}, {"id": "06a5e44e-e86e-45d9-b871-f17197acbdf3", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Rationale and presentation", "children": [{"id": "fc5d1923-7584-4f2d-839b-1a326dbd1f0b", "type": "concept", "title": "Design statements"}, {"id": "13d1344b-2d05-4538-afbe-f54611033186", "type": "concept", "title": "Process documentation"}, {"id": "f7e0511f-d25c-436b-847d-68849b30cd36", "type": "concept", "title": "Tradeoff explanation"}, {"id": "8b26f3a0-7848-49dd-80ca-e0dbffa9d405", "type": "concept", "title": "Portfolio captions"}], "description": "Gist: Students learn to explain choices as design decisions connected to audience, content, and medium."}]}, {"id": "bb1f6ddd-6a59-44e8-bed2-2ad593fcc698", "type": "topic", "title": "Capstone: Advanced Typographic Project", "description": "Synthesize advanced systems, detail, medium, voice, accessibility, and craft in a portfolio-ready typographic project.", "children": [{"id": "fa0469f6-8305-4170-8b63-937b093bca32", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Project framing", "children": [{"id": "4d5d3687-1542-49a8-bd4d-3ed76186bd8b", "type": "concept", "title": "Brief"}, {"id": "be167194-b49d-4e23-85ac-9259469832b6", "type": "concept", "title": "Audience research"}, {"id": "6a7081e4-e824-419a-ad03-e22459430566", "type": "concept", "title": "Content audit"}, {"id": "cd201f84-791a-4361-be6c-019ea015e05e", "type": "concept", "title": "Success criteria"}], "description": "Gist: The capstone begins with a clear communication problem, audience, content set, and media plan."}, {"id": "4d28e727-156e-465d-94d9-7a7987ffebce", "type": "subtopic", "title": "System build-out", "children": [{"id": "c84303ac-1bc2-4f06-b070-ef69d1fa6d3d", "type": "concept", "title": "Print artifact"}, {"id": "95d820e6-19ad-44b5-902e-0060b328a52e", "type": "concept", "title": "Screen artifact"}, {"id": "2d786ffe-75d5-41b5-a9d0-b859ceab21a8", "type": "concept", "title": "Motion or interaction element"}, {"id": "70b6b4a9-54a8-4c1a-a278-46a0997ffe2d", "type": "concept", "title": "Type guidelines"}], "description": "Gist: A world-class capstone demonstrates typographic rules across multiple artifacts."}, {"id": "5d86bf43-1b3e-48be-a97d-50caf89f565a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Final portfolio review", "children": [{"id": "8d1dabad-e4e7-4b92-a2f4-2336a7a6d387", "type": "concept", "title": "Finished deliverables"}, {"id": "b9f5ad93-1a66-4bc5-b65a-a77fe04c386e", "type": "concept", "title": "Process archive"}, {"id": "a947e194-fc8b-4185-9952-a2ad4efec63c", "type": "concept", "title": "Critique response"}, {"id": "4ce56f3b-853c-49da-97b0-21f33dbb6752", "type": "concept", "title": "Portfolio-ready case study"}], "description": "Gist: The final review tests craft, coherence, accessibility, rationale, and documentation."}]}], "dbBacked": true}$typ2json$::jsonb,
